======================================================================
  3. Confounding: a design that can't be fitted
======================================================================
Columns: 4  rank: 3 -> NOT full rank
DESeq2 says:
   the model matrix is not full rank, so the model cannot be fit as specified.
  One or more variables or interaction terms in the design formula are linear
  combinations of the others and must be remov ...
No statistics can separate two factors that always move together.
 Solve this at the DESIGN stage of an experiment, not the analysis stage.

