SV1 -0.18 0.48 -0.11
SV2  0.05 0.24 -0.01
Day8 vs Day0 significant: without SVs = 7299   with SVs = 7335 
 SVs soak up unwanted variation, but every SV costs a degree of freedom and an
 SV can also absorb real biology if it is correlated with your factor.
 Always check what the SVs correlate with before trusting them.
  saved: results/07_multifactor/pca_sv_removed.png
Never run DE on removeBatchEffect output: the model would not know degrees
 of freedom were spent. Put batch/SVs in the DESIGN instead (as above).
